roject-backend/actions/runs/37175437392).\n**Promotion triggers:** n/a (already T4).\n\nSplit of #654 (native recurring subscriptions with card-on-file trials, 6,090 lines at `02c48de7`) under the owner's PR size rule: over 3,000 changed lines is an automatic fail (MODEL_ROUTING.md 8.2, tgp-agent-context). #654 is stacked on #627 and was behind #627's head; it was merged with #627 @ `66162285` locally (clean) and cut from that tree. Stack: #627 -> R1 -> R2 -> R3; merge back to back after #627, deploy only after R3 together with mobile #334. Owner adds the Stripe webhook event `setup_intent.succeeded` before that deploy. The tree at R3 equaled the refreshed #654 at the split; since fix round 3 it is #654 plus that round (#654 is superseded). Prior verdicts on #654 (Opus APPROVE 0/0/3 at 02c48de7) do not carry. An unposted Sol draft REQUEST CHANGES 0/3/0 at 02c48de7 (resend after Stripe's 24-hour key window can create a second subscription; error label logging; a failed cancel marks a payable attempt expired) is recorded in tgp-agent-context handoffs/op-115/reports/AUD-SOL-MONEY-115.md and AUD-SOL-MONEY-2-115.md; those findings land in R2/R3; fix round 3 (B-RECUR-116) closes them in R2 (#679) and R3 (#680). Each piece needs fresh Opus 5.5 and Sol audits at its exact head (T4, money path). `tsc --noEmit` passes at every piece. When #627 merges, retarget R1 to main (CodeQL, danger, banned casts and build-sbom then run).\n\n**R2 (base R1, 2,938 lines after fix round 4):** SubscriptionCheckoutService and controller, checkout terms snapshot, the CheckoutService helpers it reuses, CheckoutModule wiring, lockout route-table entries, and the subscription-checkout and terms specs. Local: those plus checkout.service and the route-table spec 98/98.\n\n### Fix rounds\n| Round | Head | Findings | Comment |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1-2 (agents 114/115, on #654) | 795110b7, 02c48de7 | B-654-1..7, C-654-2..4 | [#654 FIX ROUND 2](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/654#issuecomment-5971989117) |\n| 3 (B-RECUR-116) | 958806d1 | B-654-5 narrowed / C-654-8 (look up before any resend; past the 24 h key window end, never re-create), B-654-8 (end only after a confirmed cancel; past_due/unpaid is the plan), B-654-9 / C-654-10 (closed allow-list errorLabel in error-label.ts) | [5976053666](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/679#issuecomment-5976053666) |\n| 4 (B-RECUR2-116 content, B-RECUR3-117 restack) | 0e1cfde0 | B-679-1..7, C-679-1, C-679-2 (test 8f1b5464, fix f83dbdd2); restack on #678 @ 2174eb7c | [5976827674](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/679#issuecomment-5976827674) |\n| 5 (B-RECUR5A-117) | 436f9d1c | Sol B-679-4, B-679-7, B-679-8; Opus B-679-8 (with #678: a trial converts only on the attempt's own card), B-679-9, C-679-3 (test 5a80d5a9, fix fc18f1d9, merges of #678 da7f40e7 / 3fbfe0b6); round-4 spec moved to #701 (436f9d1c); 2,945 lines | [5977577322](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/679#issuecomment-5977577322) |\n| 5 restack (B-RECUR5A-117) | 6760ee6a | merge-only: #678 @ b04ea692 (fees top 13c814f7); R2 content unchanged | [5977653056](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/679#issuecomment-5977653056) |\n| 6 (B-RECUR6A-118) | 8bbf4a41 | Sol B-679-7 (claim + create + bind in one transaction holding the client User row FOR KEY SHARE; stale-trial release CAS), Sol B-679-8 (unresolved rejected bind reopens the same client's row, never a second subscription), Sol/Opus B-679-10 (own SetupIntent when Stripe returns none); C-679-3 deferred (test a1365f91, fix 1638c10c, R1 calls 83827610 / 8bbf4a41, merges of #678); 2,932 lines | [5982633162](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/679#issuecomment-5982633162) |\n| 7 (B-RECUR7A-119) | 23d2c04c | Sol B-679-10 narrowed + Opus C-679-4 (no default-only settled trial), Sol B-679-11 (plan list complete fo